                            <comment id="16143863" author="amashenkov" created="Mon, 28 Aug 2017 15:05:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Seems, wrong overloaded method is used in  &lt;tt&gt;bldr.setField(&quot;str&quot;, null)&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;setField(String name, @Nullable BinaryObjectBuilder builder)&lt;/em&gt; should delegate call to &lt;em&gt;setField(String name, Object val)&lt;/em&gt; without having type passed explicitly.&lt;/p&gt;

</comment>
